  "$comment": "WIRE CONTRACT -- DO NOT HAND-EDIT. Ordinals of union RecordType (schema/REC/main.fbs) are written into the Record.value_type byte of every $REC ever serialized. They are APPEND-ONLY FOREVER: never insert, never reorder, never remove, never reuse. Append a new member at the end of the union, then run: node scripts/checkRecordTypeOrdinals.mjs --update",
